{"anim_count":1,"animations":[{"index":0,"preset_class":1,"preset_id":42,"preset_subtype":0,"seq_type":"STTLTimeNodeType_mainSeq","shape_id":"0002ab","trigger_id":"kDefaultTriggerId"}],"page_id":"000010","page_index":7,"shape_count":5,"shapes":[{"font_name":"思源黑体 CN Normal","font_size":20.0,"h":279,"id":"0002ab","text":"IO流的体系结构\r右图是常用的IO流。实际上IO流远远不止这些。\rInputStream：字节输入流\rOutputStream：字节输出流\rReader：字符输入流\rWriter：字符输出流\r以上4个流都是抽象类，是所有IO流的四大头领！！！\r所有的流都实现了Closeable接口，都有close()方法，流用完要关闭。\r所有的输出流都实现了Flushable接口，都有flush()方法，flush方法\r的作用是，将缓存清空，全部写出。养成好习惯，以防数据丢失。\r","type":"shape","w":755,"x":88,"y":85},{"children":[{"fill":"ED7D31","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","font_size":16.0,"h":0,"id":"0002ac","rot":45.0,"text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0},{"fill":"01255A","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","font_size":16.0,"h":0,"id":"0002ad","rot":45.0,"text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0},{"font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","h":0,"id":"0002ae","text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0}],"h":31,"id":"0002af","type":"group","w":37,"x":39,"y":24},{"fill":"none","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Bold","font_size":24.0,"h":39,"id":"0002b0","text":"02IO流体系结构\r\r","type":"shape","w":530,"x":85,"y":22},{"h":74,"id":"0002b1","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image3.png/qbb9nm","type":"picture","w":370,"x":696,"y":0},{"h":286,"id":"0002b2","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image5.png/qbb9nm","type":"picture","w":371,"x":546,"y":102}],"version":0}
